# Agent-local scratch: `.claude/launch.json` is written by the Storybook
# preview tooling per machine, and in the main checkout this directory is
# also where git worktrees live. Nothing here is shared. Ignoring it also
# takes it out of `biome check .` — biome reads this file
# (`vcs.useIgnoreFile`), so an untracked local config was failing the
# repo's own lint gate for reasons no commit could explain.
.claude/
